  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add Tex-Mex spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Remove from heat, then add a splash of water and mix to combine. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185bd05fc1830ec44f101/step-1d8f4f00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine deluxe salad mix and a drizzle of white winevinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.\n• Little cooks: Take the lead by tossing the salad!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185bd05fc1830ec44f101/step-b3833f10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Microwave mini flourtortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 secondbursts until warmed through.\n• Little cooks: Help warm the tortillas with oven gloves and under adult supervision. Be careful, the plate can get hot!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185bd05fc1830ec44f101/step-6e2d6220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Build tacos by spreading tortillas with BBQ mayo, then top with deluxe salad, Texan plant-based mince and Cheddar cheese to serve. Enjoy!\n• ELEVATE ME: If you’ve added extra ingredients to this recipe, top tacos with pickled jalapeños and tomato salsa. Tear over coriander to serve. Little cooks: Help with sprinkling over the cheese!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185bd05fc1830ec44f101/step-9b663130.jpg"
    }
  ]
